      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Single consolidated n8n workflow (ID: JbnB5CPdoqgCl75F) containing all 13 HTTP endpoints and 4 inlined sub-workflows. 220 nodes, 177 connections. Built by build_consolidated.py."
    },
    {
      "id": "three_agent_pipeline",
      "label": "Three-Agent Orchestrated Generation Pipeline",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "n8n/WORKFLOW_SYSTEM.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Agent 1 (Orchestrator): reads upload+brief, produces CRITERIA and PROMPT blocks plus fts_search_text. Agent 2 (Spatial-aware Retriever): picks 3 references by spatial/layout, style/materials, lighting/ambience. Agent 3 (Gemini): generates final image."
    },
    {
      "id": "spatial_aware_retrieval",
      "label": "Spatial-Aware Reference Retrieval",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "n8n/WORKFLOW_SYSTEM.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Agent 2 uses caption_enhanced and spatial_signature JSONB fields to pick references matching 3D structural fit. Spatial signature keys: room_shape, depth_cues, ceiling_height, window_wall, light_direction, focal_wall, floor_visible_pct, symmetry, open_to."
    },
    {
      "id": "fts_candidate_pool",
      "label": "FTS Candidate Pool (retrieve_candidates_text RPC)",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "n8n/WORKFLOW_SYSTEM.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Uses retrieve_candidates_text Supabase RPC (full-text search on caption_enhanced) instead of vector similarity scan. Falls back to quality-ordered unfiltered pool if FTS yields < 3 results."
    },
    {
      "id": "wf_supabase_verify",
      "label": "wf_supabase_verify Sub-workflow",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "n8n/WORKFLOW_SYSTEM.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Verifies Supabase JWT tokens by calling GET /auth/v1/user on the Supabase project. ID: 56BlN6jqFkXVszX2. Returns {ok, user_id, email} or 401."
    },
    {
      "id": "wf_save_generation",
      "label": "wf_save_generation Sub-workflow",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "n8n/WORKFLOW_SYSTEM.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "4-node sub-workflow: Assemble row (adds generation_id, output_image_path), Upload PNG to Supabase Storage, Insert generation row, Build gen response with all fields."
    },
    {
      "id": "wf_enhance_caption",
      "label": "wf_enhance_caption Sub-workflow",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "n8n/WORKFLOW_SYSTEM.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "7-node workflow. Fetches reference image, calls OpenRouter vision LLM, parses ===CAPTION=== (3-5 sentence description) and ===SPATIAL=== (JSONB) blocks, PATCHes reference_images with caption_enhanced and spatial_signature."
    },
    {
      "id": "wf_event_log",
      "label": "wf_event_log Sub-workflow",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "n8n/WORKFLOW_SYSTEM.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Fire-and-forget POST to Supabase /rest/v1/events. Input: {event_type, user_id?, session_id?, payload?}. Uses neverError:true so logging failures never block the caller."
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini_image_generation",
